.5354 cm .4 .4 .4 rg BT 13 TL/F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 30 Tm (Many health systems run separate, non-connected software platforms. Connecting AI tools to)Tj T* (existing infrastructure requires substantial investment and technical work that smaller institutions)Tj T* (often cannot afford.)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 76.53543 592.5354 cm .866667 .866667 .866667 RG 1 J 1 j .5 w 0 0 m 442.2047 0 l S Q Q q 1 0 0 1 57.02362 548.3622 cm .752941 .223529 .168627 rg BT 12 TL/F1 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 3.5 Tm (SECTION 06)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 57.02362 524.3622 cm .105882 .164706 .290196 rg BT 20 TL/F2 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 5 Tm (Future Scope)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 57.02362 513.3622 cm .752941 .223529 .168627 RG 1 J 0 0 m 481.2283 0 l S Q q 1 0 0 1 76.53543 207.3622 cm .972549 .972549 .972549 rg 0 296 90.70866 -296 re f* 1 1 1 rg 90.70866 296 351.4961 -296 re f* q 1 0 0 1 10 274 cm .752941 .223529 .168627 rg BT 12 TL/F2 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 11.33783 3 Tm (2025 - 2026)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 100.7087 274 cm .105882 .164706 .290196 rg BT 12 TL/F2 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 2 Tm (Combined Data Models)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 100.7087 232 cm .4 .4 .4 rg BT 13 TL/F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 30 Tm (Tools that pull from imaging, labs, genomics, and wearable devices at the same)Tj T* (time are moving into large hospital settings, giving clinicians a more complete)Tj T* (picture of each patient.)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 10 200 cm .752941 .223529 .168627 rg BT 12 TL/F2 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 11.33783 3 Tm (2027 - 2028)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 100.7087 200 cm .105882 .164706 .290196 rg BT 12 TL/F2 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 2 Tm (Disease Surveillance Networks)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 100.7087 158 cm .4 .4 .4 rg BT 13 TL/F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 30 Tm (Public health agencies are building AI systems that watch wastewater data, travel)Tj T* (records, and reported symptoms to detect outbreaks earlier than current methods)Tj T* (allow.)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 10 126 cm .752941 .223529 .168627 rg BT 12 TL/F2 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 11.33783 3 Tm (2028 - 2030)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 100.7087 126 cm .105882 .164706 .